# UI Design — Must Use Project Skills

When the task involves **designing, redesigning, or styling user-facing UI** (landing pages, public career pages, marketing sections, portfolios, hero layouts), you **MUST** follow the project skill before writing or editing code.

## Required skill

| Item | Path |
|------|------|
| Skill file | `.cursor/skills/SKILL.md` |
| Skill name | `design-taste-frontend` |

**Do not improvise UI aesthetics without reading this skill first.**

## When this rule applies

- New public/marketing pages (e.g. `/`, `/public/jobs`, job detail, apply flow)
- Landing page sections (About us, Career opportunities, hero, footer)
- Visual redesigns of existing pages
- Any task where the user asks to "make it beautiful", "landing page style", or "design UI"

## Mandatory workflow

1. **Read** `.cursor/skills/SKILL.md` in full (or the relevant sections if the task is narrow).
2. **Declare Design Read** (Section 0.B of the skill) in one line before coding:
   - Page kind, audience, vibe, design system direction.
3. **Set dials** from the skill (Section 1): `DESIGN_VARIANCE`, `MOTION_INTENSITY`, `VISUAL_DENSITY` — justify from the brief, do not use defaults blindly.
4. **Match project stack** (Section 3 of the skill):
   - This repo uses React + Vite + Tailwind + shadcn/ui + Lucide (existing convention).
   - Reuse existing components under `src/shared/components/ui/` and patterns from HR/public pages.
5. **Run Pre-Flight Check** (Section 14 of the skill) before considering the UI task done.

## Out of scope for this skill (do not force taste-skill on)

- HR dashboard / admin tables / dense data UI (`/hr/**`, `/admin/**`)
- API services, types, auth logic
- i18n-only or copy-only changes with no layout impact

For dashboard/admin UI, follow existing `AppLayout`, `PageHeader`, `BaseTable`, and shadcn patterns in the codebase instead.

## Integration with this repo

| Area | Convention |
|------|------------|
| Public routes | `src/pages/public/*`, no sidebar, light theme unless brief says otherwise |
| Landing | `src/pages/Index.tsx` — About us + Career opportunities |
| Shared apply form | `PublicApplyJobDialog.tsx` — reuse, do not duplicate |
| i18n | Add keys to `src/shared/i18n/locales/{en,vi,zh-TW}.ts` |
| API | `src/shared/lib/api-services.ts` — no UI logic in services |

## Anti-patterns (forbidden without explicit user request)

- Shipping generic AI-slop UI (purple gradients, 3 equal feature cards, centered dark hero) — see skill Section 9
- Creating a second apply-form implementation instead of reusing `PublicApplyJobDialog`
- Hardcoding long marketing copy in components without i18n keys
- Ignoring the skill because "this is a small change"

